@19034 = ~This wand will summon 12 HD of monsters, which appear within the area of effect and attack the user's enemies. They remain until the spell duration expires or the monsters are slain. These creatures vanish when slain. If no opponent exists to fight and the wizard can communicate with them, the summoned monsters can perform other services for the summoning wizard.

STATISTICS:

Charge abilities:
– Summon 12 HD of monsters
  Range: 20 ft.
  Duration: 2 turns

Requires:
 9 Intelligence

Weight: 1~
