@25504 = ~This small bag is ideally suited for holding gems.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
@25505 = ~Scroll Case~
@25506 = ~Scroll Case~
@25507 = ~This sturdy container allows dozens of scrolls to be placed in it, safe from exposure to fire, rain, or lightning—common hazards faced by any adventuring wizard.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
@25508 = ~Potion Case~
@25509 = ~Potion Case~
@25510 = ~Typically carried by traveling healers, this leather case folds open and allows the user to strap delicate potion bottles to its cushioned side with numerous leather thongs for safe storage during travel.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 2~
